From: Guilhem Moulin <guilhem@debian.org>
Date: Sun, 13 Mar 2022 00:08:19 +0100
Subject: Fix autoload locations

Snippets generated with `phpabtpl --suggest bacon/bacon-qr-code` and
`phpabtpl --suggest GuzzleHttp`.

Rebased for 1.7.4: upstream moved qrcode.php's `use BaconQrCode\...`
imports above the file's header comment block (rcmail_oauth.php's own
`use GuzzleHttp\...` imports are unaffected, still below the header);
the inserted snippet keeps its position immediately before the code
that needs it, now after the header block in both files rather than
context-matching the (in qrcode.php's case, since-relocated) `use`
block that immediately used to follow it.

Without this, program/lib/Roundcube/bootstrap.php's generic
rcube_autoload() is the only mechanism that ever resolves these
classes (this build never runs `composer install`, so
`vendor/autoload.php` never exists) and it assumes a class's PHP
namespace root maps 1:1 onto the installed Debian package's directory
layout. That holds for GuzzleHttp (php-guzzlehttp-guzzle installs
under /usr/share/php/GuzzleHttp/ directly), but not for BaconQrCode:
php-bacon-qr-code installs under an extra vendor-style prefix,
/usr/share/php/Bacon/BaconQrCode/, so class_exists() on any
BaconQrCode\* class was always false and the QR-code contact-export
feature was silently unavailable, regardless of architecture, despite
php-bacon-qr-code being a correctly declared and satisfiable
dependency on amd64.

Forwarded: not-needed
Bug-Debian: https://bugs.debian.org/1040705
---
 program/actions/contacts/qrcode.php | 3 +++
 program/include/rcmail_oauth.php    | 3 +++
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+)

Index: rc-build/program/actions/contacts/qrcode.php
===================================================================
--- rc-build.orig/program/actions/contacts/qrcode.php
+++ rc-build/program/actions/contacts/qrcode.php
@@ -22,6 +22,9 @@
  | Author: Aleksander Machniak <alec@alec.pl>                            |
  +-----------------------------------------------------------------------+
 */
+
+if (stream_resolve_include_path('Bacon/BaconQrCode/autoload.php'))
+    include_once('Bacon/BaconQrCode/autoload.php');

 class rcmail_action_contacts_qrcode extends rcmail_action_contacts_index
 {
Index: rc-build/program/include/rcmail_oauth.php
===================================================================
--- rc-build.orig/program/include/rcmail_oauth.php
+++ rc-build/program/include/rcmail_oauth.php
@@ -18,6 +18,9 @@
  | Author: Thomas Bruederli <roundcube@gmail.com>                        |
  +-----------------------------------------------------------------------+
 */
+
+if (stream_resolve_include_path('GuzzleHttp/autoload.php'))
+    include_once 'GuzzleHttp/autoload.php';

 use GuzzleHttp\Client as HttpClient;
 use GuzzleHttp\Exception\RequestException;
